Package: nwrspeciesr
Title: Interface to the FWS NWRSpecies Occurrence Database API
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "McCrea", family = "Cobb", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mccrea_cobb@fws.gov", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9412-1468"))
Description: Provides an R interface to the U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service
    National Wildlife Refuge System species occurrence database (NWRSpecies,
    formerly FWSpecies), including public retrieval endpoints and experimental
    authenticated upload endpoints.
